NAME
       bal edi convertEdifactSchema - EDIFACT Schema Conversion to Ballerina EDI

SYNOPSIS
       bal edi convertEdifactSchema [OPTIONS]

DESCRIPTION
       The 'bal edi convertEdifactSchema' command is used to convert
       EDIFACT schema to Ballerina EDI schema.

       The UNECE site serving the EDIFACT directories requires a browser, so the
       directory has to be downloaded and passed in with the '-i' option.
       Download the release archive for the required version from
       https://unece.org/trade/uncefact/unedifact/download.

OPTIONS
       -v, --version <EDIFACT version>
           EDIFACT version for EDIFACT schema conversion.

       -t, --type <EDIFACT message type>
           EDIFACT message type for EDIFACT schema conversion. All message types
           in the directory are converted when this is not given.

       -i, --input <EDIFACT directory path>
           Path to the downloaded UNECE directory archive or to a directory it
           was extracted to.

       -o, --output <output folder>
           Path to the folder where EDIFACT schemas will be generated.

EXAMPLE
       Convert EDIFACT schema to Ballerina EDI schema.
           $ bal edi convertEdifactSchema -v d03a -t ORDERS -i d03a.zip -o output/
